    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7ckrarp",
      "content": "Key Wildlife of J&amp;K:"
    },
    {
      "id": "rompbbp",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Hangul (Kashmir Stag): State animal; only population in Dachigam NP; critically endangered",
        "Snow Leopard: Found in higher altitudes; Hemis NP has highest density",
        "Markhor: State animal of Pakistan; found in Hirpora WLS",
        "Musk Deer: Found in temperate/alpine zones",
        "Black-necked Crane: Ladakh; endangered; breeds at high altitude",
        "Tibetan Wild Ass (Kiang): Ladakh; Hanle &amp; Tso Moriri area",
        "Great Indian Bustard: Occasionally spotted in Jammu region"
      ]
    },
    {
